## 3. Endpoints públicos (sin autenticación)

### 3.1 Registrar persona natural

**POST** `{{baseUrl}}/api/users/register/natural-person`

Body:

```json
{
  "fullName": "Juan Pérez",
  "identificationNumber": "1234567890",
  "email": "juan@example.com",
  "phone": "3001234567",
  "birthDate": "1995-05-20",
  "address": "Calle 10 #20-30, Medellín",
  "username": "juanperez",
  "password": "secret123"
}
```

Respuesta esperada (201 Created):

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Natural person registered successfully",
  "data": {
    "id": 1,
    "fullName": "Juan Pérez",
    "identificationNumber": "1234567890",
    "email": "juan@example.com",
    "phone": "3001234567",
    "birthDate": "1995-05-20",
    "address": "Calle 10 #20-30, Medellín",
    "username": "juanperez"
  }
}
```

Se guarda en las tablas `users` (credenciales + rol `NATURAL_PERSON_CLIENT`) y `natural_person_clients`.

### 3.2 Registrar empresa

**POST** `{{baseUrl}}/api/users/register/company`

Body:

```json
{
  "legalName": "ACME S.A.S.",
  "taxId": "900123456-7",
  "email": "contacto@acme.com",
  "phone": "6041234567",
  "address": "Carrera 50 #10-20, Medellín",
  "legalRepresentativeId": "1234567890",
  "username": "acme",
  "password": "secret123"
}
```

Se guarda en `users` (rol `COMPANY_CLIENT`) y `company_clients`.

### 3.3 Login

**POST** `{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login`

Body:

```json
{
  "username": "juanperez",
  "password": "secret123"
}
```

Respuesta:

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Login successful",
  "data": {
    "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJyb2xlIjoiTkFUVVJBTF9QRVJTT05fQ0xJRU5UIi...",
    "username": "juanperez",
    "role": "NATURAL_PERSON_CLIENT",
    "userId": 1
  }
}
```

Copia el valor del campo `token` y pégalo en la variable `{{token}}` de la colección (o usa el script de Tests del paso 2 para que se guarde solo).

