## 9. Consultas SQL útiles para depurar

```sql
USE banco_db;

-- Ver todos los usuarios
SELECT id, username, full_name, role, status FROM users;

-- Ver todas las cuentas
SELECT id, account_number, owner_id, balance, currency, status FROM bank_accounts;

-- Ver transferencias
SELECT id, source_account_number, destination_account_number, amount, status, created_at FROM transfers;

-- Ver préstamos
SELECT id, client_id, requested_amount, approved_amount, status FROM loans;

-- Cambiar rol de un usuario
UPDATE users SET role = 'INTERNAL_ANALYST' WHERE username = 'juanperez';

-- Cargar saldo manualmente a una cuenta
UPDATE bank_accounts SET balance = 1000000 WHERE account_number = '1000000001';

-- Resetear todo (cuidado: borra los datos)
TRUNCATE TABLE transfers;
TRUNCATE TABLE loans;
TRUNCATE TABLE bank_accounts;
DELETE FROM natural_person_clients;
DELETE FROM company_clients;
DELETE FROM users;
```

